  "post_content": "<p>(15 fotos) Simi Slatinsk&agrave; ho t&eacute; tot preparat per a ser proclamada aquest dissabte, a partir de les 19 hores al Teatre M&ograve;naco, com a reina de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2019.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_6422.jpg\" style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); cursor: default; font-family: Arial,Verdana,sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; height: 320px; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; width: 480px; word-spacing: 0px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquesta setmana ha mostrat els vestits que lluir&agrave; durant les festes i</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/10/IMG_6403.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>ha intercanviat un regal amb la seua dama, Elisabeth Brun L&oacute;pez.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafira19/img_6403.jpg\" alt=\"img_6403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafira19/img_6404.jpg\" alt=\"img_6404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafira19/img_6406.jpg\" alt=\"img_6406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafira19/img_6408.jpg\" alt=\"img_6408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafira19/img_6410.jpg\" alt=\"img_6410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/vestitssimireinafi